    "rationale": "The undiluted readings plateau at about 0.76 from 5 h onward. A 10-fold dilution of the 18 h aliquot read 0.264 (replicates 0.261 and 0.267), which corresponds to an OD of about 2.6, not 0.75. That is a clear non-linear, saturating response of the undiluted reading. The 5 h aliquot diluted 10-fold read 0.082, or about 0.82 corrected, against 0.725 undiluted. This shows the compression starting at that point. The plateau therefore reflects the reading ceiling and not stationary phase at 0.76, so the late biomass is higher than the readings indicate."
